msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His loud and booming voice echoed through the room."
msgstr "Jego głośny i donośny głos rozbrzmiewał w całym pomieszczeniu."

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "All that pride of your daddy, and where is it now?"
msgstr "Cała ta duma twojego tatusia — i gdzie ona teraz jest?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah gritted her teeth. She tried to endure his taunts, but it was hard when she could also feel him inside of her."
