msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Alright then, let's make this official, follow me."
msgstr "No dobrze, zróbmy to oficjalnie – chodź za mną."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched captain Belmont turn around and head below deck. Dutifully, she followed."
