msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hour turned upon hour, and any single experience of the moment was now gone, lost to the torrent of events."
msgstr "Godziny mijały jedna po drugiej, a każde pojedyncze doświadczenie z danego momentu znikało, pogrążone w nieustannym strumieniu wydarzeń."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In the end, it was not Sarah who noticed the dawn, but an off-hand comment from one of the men who was taking her."
